  • Independently reclassify every rule from frozen K sources and semantics
  • Run trusted Stage 4 preflight and audit manifests, obligations, and target identity
  • If in proof mode, clean-build a fresh Lean copy and audit target, bridge definitions, and axioms
  • Write self-contained REVIEW.md with evidence-backed final verdict pair
