codex
The failure is now isolated to the audit sandbox’s PID/proc mismatch: Lean 4.22 resolves its executable via `/proc/<getpid()>/exe`, but this sandbox exposes only `/proc/self/exe` for the namespaced process. The pinned Lean files themselves are present. I’m trying a contained process-namespace invocation first; if unavailable, I’ll use a narrowly scoped readlink shim only for the preflight subprocess and preserve that workaround as evidence.
